  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DID TO51 - Inclusive Education in Shinyanga and Mwanza Regions, Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Task Order will directly support 1,880 (90% primary, 10% pre-primary) girls and boys with disabilities across 11 Wards in Shinyanga rural, Shinyanga MC and Misungwi districts to access and participate in primary and pre-primary education on an equal basis to their peers. This will be achieved through the collaboration of a wide range of stakeholders, including OPDs, parents, communities, teachers, headteachers and Ward, District, Regional and National Government Officials.</narrative>
  </description>
